nologies to its export control list", "summary": "China's commerce ministry proposed adding 40 technologies, including AI models, agents and computing clusters, biomedicine and photovoltaic tech, to its catalogue of technologies prohibited or restricted from export; comments are open until Nov 15 and an interim registration requirement for transfers abroad takes effect immediately.", "url": "https://www.thestandard.com.hk/finance/article/345689/China-proposes-adding-40-AI-biotech-solar-technologies-to-export-control-list", "source": "The Standard (Reuters)", "scale": "notable", "category": "trade-policy", "region": "China", "c": -0.087, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "ab4c3c4fad82", "ts": "2026-10-16T05:49:00Z", "title": "Taiwan to curb AI chip exports to China as part of US trade deal", "summary": "Bloomberg reported Taiwan will restrict exports of advanced AI chips to China under its trade deal with the US. Earlier reporting (June) said Taipei was weighing rules covering all Chinese customers and making smuggling a crime.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOSU1LakZhV2xQNHBFM0lFWU9pT1JCdGMyTXY4Q01TSjZYd3dNbWZ4Rk50ME1UQnUzVkgta3U0RFpFY0VNZGNaeXZfV25jZm9lMjBDdjVONUhlMmJKLTNwT2xwM1I0Mkl5N2N2c25IQWZwbWtORDRYbUJMMC1hZXhWbzllSFZ2bDJzNThDSFRYYmVyYXJnSVc4V0QzVjFMWHBQWVc4NTlRb1E0WEJsYVl1OV9yZEFBQQ?oc=5", "source": "Bloomberg", "scale": "notable", "category": "trade-policy", "region": "Asia", "c": -0.084, "via": "semis"}, {"id": "84c07710a8c6", "ts": "2026-10-17T12:34:36Z", "title": "Chip index SOX posts longest losing streak since 2008 as AI worries deepen", "summary": "Yahoo Finance reports the Philadelphia Semiconductor Index ended the week on its longest losing streak since 2008; Opening Bell Daily put the week's chip-stock drop at about 12% through 16 October. Earlier this week Bloomberg noted roughly a 10% drop over six sessions.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPMkdxRllqcjRqT3VRQjZSRmJULUEyZTJKZVQweXhCTEZwa0cxOVM4bWlJRm